/*
 * what is an bootloader ?
 * is software or firmware that is used to done init and transfer control to the application program
 * used to program the flash chip using serial device peripherals / update firmware
 * with the bootloader the firmware can be updated over the air , via a wired or wireless connection , or even by end user using simple interface *
 * bootloader can also provide recovery mechanism , load another firmware from another slot incase the primary fails /
 */

/*Modules
